<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμερ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impart, give a portion</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				31.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				39.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. Astrol.,
				<i>assign</i> a number of years to life, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				164.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>distribute</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς τοῖς</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φράτραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					2.50
				</span></i>
			; esp. in Gramm., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσωπα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					92.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμεριζόμενον</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>
			<i>distributive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				637.15
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενικὴ-ομένη</span>
			<i>partitive</i> genitive, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				35.1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be distributed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς
				πλείονας</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>mention
				severally, enumerate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				<u>Epim.</u>
				157
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
